<DocsLayout
  title="First-Time Setup"
  description="Configure RefleK's for your KovaaK's installation."
  prevPage={{ slug: "installation", title: "Installation" }}
  nextPage={{ slug: "automatic-tracking", title: "Automatic Tracking" }}
>
  <h2>Automatic Detection</h2>
  <p>
    RefleK's is designed to work out of the box. When you first launch it, it
    will automatically:
  </p>
  <ul>
    <li>
      Detect your KovaaK's installation folder from your Steam installation
    </li>
    <li>Locate your stats and performances folders within it</li>
    <li>Start monitoring for new scenario runs</li>
    <li>Import your existing stats history</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>Default Settings</h2>
  <p>RefleK's comes with sensible defaults that work for most users:</p>
  <ul>
    <li>
      <strong>KovaaK's Install Folder:</strong> Automatically detected from your Steam
      installation
    </li>
    <li>
      <strong>Session gap:</strong> 20 minutes (runs within this gap are grouped together)
    </li>
    <li>
      <strong>Mouse tracking:</strong> Disabled by default (enable in settings if
      desired)
    </li>
    <li><strong>Theme:</strong> Dark mode</li>
    <li><strong>Autostart:</strong> Disabled by default</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>Autostart with KovaaK's</h2>
  <p>RefleK's can start automatically when you launch KovaaK's:</p>
  <ol>
    <li>Open Settings (gear icon in the top right)</li>
    <li>Go to General → Autostart with KovaaK's</li>
    <li>Toggle it on</li>
  </ol>
  <p>
    When enabled, RefleK's starts hidden with Windows and opens automatically
    when KovaaK's launches. Closing the window keeps it running in memory for
    quick access.
  </p>

  <h2>Manual Configuration</h2>
  <p>
    If RefleK's can't detect your KovaaK's installation automatically, you can
    set it manually:
  </p>
  <ol>
    <li>Open Settings (gear icon in the top right)</li>
    <li>Go to General → KovaaK's Install Folder</li>
    <li>
      Enter the path to your KovaaK's installation folder (the folder containing <code
        >FPSAimTrainer</code
      >)
    </li>
  </ol>

  <p>The default KovaaK's installation location on Windows is:</p>
  <p>
    <code>C:\Program Files (x86)\Steam\steamapps\common\FPSAimTrainer</code>
  </p>

  <p>
    RefleK's will automatically look for stats and performances within the <code
      >FPSAimTrainer</code
    > subfolder.
  </p>

  <div class="note">
    <strong>Tip:</strong> If you have a custom Steam library location, KovaaK's will
    be installed in that library's steamapps folder instead.
  </div>

  <h2>Steam Integration</h2>
  <p>
    For benchmark rankings, RefleK's detects your Steam username from your local
    Steam installation and uses it to fetch your progress from KovaaK's servers.
    This is automatic on Windows - no Steam profile visibility settings
    required.
  </p>
</DocsLayout>
